Reference data
--------------

The taxonomic, conservation and geographic reference data shipped under
inst/extdata/ originates from third-party sources (Flora e Funga do Brasil /
JBRJ, Catalogo Taxonomico da Fauna do Brasil, IBGE, MMA, Instituto Horus,
GRIIS). That data remains under the terms of its respective publishers and is
redistributed here for use within this application only. Provenance and versions
are recorded in the .meta.json sidecar next to each dataset.
